          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "TL 00 NE                    REDBOURN             REDBOURN ROAD (B487 )                                                  (south side)                                                  REDBOURN 8/238                                            Wood End Farm Cottages,                                                  (Nos 1 and 2) II Cottage pair.  Late C16 or early C17 timber frame, doubled at rear in mid-late C19.  Plain tile roof.  C17 and C20 red brick casing to the  front, stucco on the rear.  2 storeys.  The front part is 2 bays.   3 glazing bar casements, right one segmental headed.  C17 end chimney stacks, restored C20.  Rear part with 4 recessed sash windows. Listing NGR: TL0855009948"
    }
  ],
